# Neptune EHSS Frontend

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. This is Next.js 16 with breaking API changes — read guides in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before changing framework code.

## Stack

- Next.js App Router under `src/app/`
- React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4
- Auth routes live in `src/app/(auth)/`

## Commands

- `npm run dev` — local dev server
- `npm run build` — production build
- `npm run lint` — ESLint
